eft="141" Right="141" Top="141"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ColumnBreak="false" PageBreak="false" ParaShape="24" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="12"><COLDEF Count="1" Layout="Left" SameGap="0" SameSize="true" Type="Newspaper"/><CHAR>개요</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL></ROW></TABLE><CHAR/></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="21" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="20"><CHAR>○○시는 2025년 1월부터 3월까지 3개월 간
스마트 민원처리 시스템을 3개 동 행정복지센터에 시범 도입하였으며,
시스템의 실효성, 민원인 반응, 행정 효율성 등에 대한 분석 결과를 보고합니다.</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="21" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="16"><TABLE BorderFill="3" CellSpacing="0" ColCount="3" PageBreak="Cell" RepeatHeader="true" RowCount="1"><SHAPEOBJECT InstId="1805978309" Lock="false" NumberingType="Table" ZOrder="1"><SIZE Height="3231" HeightRelTo="Absolute" Protect="false" Width="31181" WidthRelTo="Absolute"/><POSITION AffectLSpacing="false" AllowOverlap="false" FlowWithText="true" HoldAnchorAndSO="false" HorzAlign="Left" HorzOffset="0" HorzRelTo="Para" TreatAsChar="true" VertAlign="Top" VertOffset="0" VertRelTo="Para"/><OUTSIDEMARGIN Bottom="283" Left="283" Right="283" Top="283"/></SHAPEOBJECT><INSIDEMARGIN Bottom="141" Left="141" Right="141" Top="141"/><ROW><CELL BorderFill="6" ColAddr="0" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="false" HasMargin="false" Header="false" Height="3231" Protect="false" RowAddr="0" RowSpan="1" Width="3705"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="141" Left="141" Right="141" Top="141"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="23" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="8"><CHAR>Ⅱ</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="7" ColAddr="1" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="false" HasMargin="false" Header="false" Height="3231" Protect="false" RowAddr="0" RowSpan="1" Width="1131"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="141" Left="141" Right="141" Top="141"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="0" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"/></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="8" ColAddr="2" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="false" HasMargin="false" Header="false" Height="3231" Protect="false" RowAddr="0" RowSpan="1" Width="26345"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="141" Left="141" Right="141" Top="141"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ColumnBreak="false" PageBreak="false" ParaShape="24" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="12"><COLDEF Count="1" Layout="Left" SameGap="0" SameSize="true" Type="Newspaper"/><CHAR>운영 개요</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL></ROW></TABLE><CHAR/></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="29" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="23"><CHAR>❍ </CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="20"><CHAR>도입 시스템: 스마트 민원창구 통합 솔루션 (K-민원 V2.1)</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="29" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="23"><CHAR>❍ </CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="20"><CHAR>운영 기관: ○○1동, ○○2동, ○○3동</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="29" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="23"><CHAR>❍ </CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="20"><CHAR>도입 목적: 대기시간 단축, 민원서식 자동화, 응대 정확도 향상</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="21" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="16"><TABLE BorderFill="3" CellSpacing="0" ColCount="3" PageBreak="Cell" RepeatHeader="true" RowCount="1"><SHAPEOBJECT InstId="1805978309" Lock="false" NumberingType="Table" ZOrder="1"><SIZE Height="3231" HeightRelTo="Absolute" Protect="false" Width="31181" WidthRelTo="Absolute"/><POSITION AffectLSpacing="false" AllowOverlap="false" FlowWithText="true" HoldAnchorAndSO="false" HorzAlign="Left" HorzOffset="0" HorzRelTo="Para" TreatAsChar="true" VertAlign="Top" VertOffset="0" VertRelTo="Para"/><OUTSIDEMARGIN Bottom="283" Left="283" Right="283" Top="283"/></SHAPEOBJECT><INSIDEMARGIN Bottom="141" Left="141" Right="141" Top="141"/><ROW><CELL BorderFill="6" ColAddr="0" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="false" HasMargin="false" Header="false" Height="3231" Protect="false" RowAddr="0" RowSpan="1" Width="3705"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="141" Left="141" Right="141" Top="141"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="23" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="8"><CHAR>Ⅲ</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="7" ColAddr="1" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="false" HasMargin="false" Header="false" Height="3231" Protect="false" RowAddr="0" RowSpan="1" Width="1131"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="141" Left="141" Right="141" Top="141"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="0" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"/></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="8" ColAddr="2" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="false" HasMargin="false" Header="false" Height="3231" Protect="false" RowAddr="0" RowSpan="1" Width="26345"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="141" Left="141" Right="141" Top="141"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ColumnBreak="false" PageBreak="false" ParaShape="24" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="12"><COLDEF Count="1" Layout="Left" SameGap="0" SameSize="true" Type="Newspaper"/><CHAR>성과 요약</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL></ROW></TABLE><CHAR/></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="21" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="25"><CHAR>1. 평균 민원 처리시간 단축</CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="20"><CHAR>
기존 평균 7분 → 시범운영 후 평균 4분 21초로 단축됨</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="21" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="25"><CHAR>2. 오류율 감소</CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="20"><CHAR>
민원 서식 기재 오류율: 5.6% → </CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="25"><CHAR>1.4%</CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="20"><CHAR> (평균 기준)</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="21" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="25"><CHAR>3. 만족도 향상</CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="20"><CHAR>
현장 설문 결과, 응답자 83.2%가 "기존보다 편리하다"고 응답</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="21" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="16"><TABLE BorderFill="3" CellSpacing="0" ColCount="3" PageBreak="Cell" RepeatHeader="true" RowCount="1"><SHAPEOBJECT InstId="1805978309" Lock="false" NumberingType="Table" ZOrder="1"><SIZE Height="3231" HeightRelTo="Absolute" Protect="false" Width="31181" WidthRelTo="Absolute"/><POSITION AffectLSpacing="false" AllowOverlap="false" FlowWithText="true" HoldAnchorAndSO="false" HorzAlign="Left" HorzOffset="0" HorzRelTo="Para" TreatAsChar="true" VertAlign="Top" VertOffset="0" VertRelTo="Para"/><OUTSIDEMARGIN Bottom="283" Left="283" Right="283" Top="283"/></SHAPEOBJECT><INSIDEMARGIN Bottom="141" Left="141" Right="141" Top="141"/><ROW><CELL BorderFill="6" ColAddr="0" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="false" HasMargin="false" Header="false" Height="3231" Protect="false" RowAddr="0" RowSpan="1" Width="3705"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="141" Left="141" Right="141" Top="141"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="23" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="8"><CHAR>Ⅳ</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="7" ColAddr="1" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="false" HasMargin="false" Header="false" Height="3231" Protect="false" RowAddr="0" RowSpan="1" Width="1131"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="141" Left="141" Right="141" Top="141"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="0" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"/></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="8" ColAddr="2" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="false" HasMargin="false" Header="false" Height="3231" Protect="false" RowAddr="0" RowSpan="1" Width="26345"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="141" Left="141" Right="141" Top="141"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ColumnBreak="false" PageBreak="false" ParaShape="24" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="12"><COLDEF Count="1" Layout="Left" SameGap="0" SameSize="true" Type="Newspaper"/><CHAR>현장 피드백 요약</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL></ROW></TABLE><CHAR/></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="21" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="16"><TABLE BorderFill="3" CellSpacing="0" ColCount="3" PageBreak="Cell" RepeatHeader="true" RowCount="1"><SHAPEOBJECT InstId="1805978309" Lock="false" NumberingType="Table" ZOrder="1"><SIZE Height="3231" HeightRelTo="Absolute" Protect="false" Width="42250" WidthRelTo="Absolute"/><POSITION AffectLSpacing="false" AllowOverlap="false" FlowWithText="true" HoldAnchorAndSO="false" HorzAlign="Left" HorzOffset="0" HorzRelTo="Para" TreatAsChar="true" VertAlign="Top" VertOffset="0" VertRelTo="Para"/><OUTSIDEMARGIN Bottom="283" Left="283" Right="283" Top="283"/></SHAPEOBJECT><INSIDEMARGIN Bottom="141" Left="141" Right="141" Top="141"/><ROW><CELL BorderFill="6" ColAddr="0" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="false" HasMargin="false" Header="false" Height="3231" Protect="false" RowAddr="0" RowSpan="1" Width="3705"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="141" Left="141" Right="141" Top="141"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="23" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="8"><CHAR>Ⅴ</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="7" ColAddr="1" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="false" HasMargin="false" Header="false" Height="3231" Protect="false" RowAddr="0" RowSpan="1" Width="1131"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="141" Left="141" Right="141" Top="141"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="0" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"/></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="8" ColAddr="2" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="false" HasMargin="false" Header="false" Height="3231" Protect="false" RowAddr="0" RowSpan="1" Width="37414"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="141" Left="141" Right="141" Top="141"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ColumnBreak="false" PageBreak="false" ParaShape="24" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="12"><COLDEF Count="1" Layout="Left" SameGap="0" SameSize="true" Type="Newspaper"/><CHAR>문제점 및 개선 필요사항</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL></ROW></TABLE><CHAR/></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="29" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="23"><CHAR>1. </CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="20"><CHAR>일부 시스템 조작에 대한 직원 교육 부족</CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="20"><CHAR>
</CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="20"><CHAR>
</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="29" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="23"><CHAR>  ❍ </CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="20"><CHAR>새로 배정된 임시직원은 사용법 숙지에 어려움을 호소</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="29" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="23"><CHAR>  ❍ </CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="20"><CHAR>향후 배치 전 교육과 매뉴얼 보완 필요</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="29" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="23"><CHAR>2. </CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="20"><CHAR>기기별 성능 편차</CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="20"><CHAR>
</CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="20"><CHAR>
</CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="20"><CHAR>| 센터 | 발급처리 평균시간(초) | 비고 |
|-------|---------------------|------|
| ○○1동 | 42 | 구형 프린터 사용 |
| ○○2동 | 21 | 정상 작동 |
| ○○3동 | 24 | 우수 |</CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="20"><CHAR>
</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="29" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="23"><CHAR>  ❍ </CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="20"><CHAR>○○1동 센터에서는 프린터 속도가 현저히 느림</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="29" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="23"><CHAR>3. </CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="20"><CHAR>일부 민원서식 누락</CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="20"><CHAR>
</CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="20"><CHAR>
</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="29" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="23"><CHAR>  ❍ </CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="20"><CHAR>등·초본 관련 민원서식이 시스템에 반영되지 않아 수기작성 발생</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="21" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="16"><TABLE BorderFill="3" CellSpacing="0" ColCount="3" PageBreak="Cell" RepeatHeader="true" RowCount="1"><SHAPEOBJECT InstId="1805978309" Lock="false" NumberingType="Table" ZOrder="1"><SIZE Height="3231" HeightRelTo="Absolute" Protect="false" Width="31181" WidthRelTo="Absolute"/><POSITION AffectLSpacing="false" AllowOverlap="false" FlowWithText="true" HoldAnchorAndSO="false" HorzAlign="Left" HorzOffset="0" HorzRelTo="Para" TreatAsChar="true" VertAlign="Top" VertOffset="0" VertRelTo="Para"/><OUTSIDEMARGIN Bottom="283" Left="283" Right="283" Top="283"/></SHAPEOBJECT><INSIDEMARGIN Bottom="141" Left="141" Right="141" Top="141"/><ROW><CELL BorderFill="6" ColAddr="0" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="false" HasMargin="false" Header="false" Height="3231" Protect="false" RowAddr="0" RowSpan="1" Width="3705"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="141" Left="141" Right="141" Top="141"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="23" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="8"><CHAR>Ⅵ</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="7" ColAddr="1" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="false" HasMargin="false" Header="false" Height="3231" Protect="false" RowAddr="0" RowSpan="1" Width="1131"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="141" Left="141" Right="141" Top="141"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="0" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"/></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="8" ColAddr="2" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="false" HasMargin="false" Header="false" Height="3231" Protect="false" RowAddr="0" RowSpan="1" Width="26345"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="141" Left="141" Right="141" Top="141"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ColumnBreak="false" PageBreak="false" ParaShape="24" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="12"><COLDEF Count="1" Layout="Left" SameGap="0" SameSize="true" Type="Newspaper"/><CHAR>향후 계획</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL></ROW></TABLE><CHAR/></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="29" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="23"><CHAR>❍ </CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="20"><CHAR>시스템 정식 도입 여부는 6월 최종평가 후 결정</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="29" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="23"><CHAR>❍ </CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="20"><CHAR>5월 중 전체 동 센터 대상 </CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="25"><CHAR>사전 설명회 및 체험교육 시행 예정</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="29" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="23"><CHAR>❍ </CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="20"><CHAR>제안사항은 별도 회신 없이 반영 가능하므로, 실무자 의견 수렴은 지속적으로 진행됨</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="21" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="16"><TABLE BorderFill="3" CellSpacing="0" ColCount="3" PageBreak="Cell" RepeatHeader="true" RowCount="1"><SHAPEOBJECT InstId="1805978309" Lock="false" NumberingType="Table" ZOrder="1"><SIZE Height="3231" HeightRelTo="Absolute" Protect="false" Width="31181" WidthRelTo="Absolute"/><POSITION AffectLSpacing="false" AllowOverlap="false" FlowWithText="true" HoldAnchorAndSO="false" HorzAlign="Left" HorzOffset="0" HorzRelTo="Para" TreatAsChar="true" VertAlign="Top" VertOffset="0" VertRelTo="Para"/><OUTSIDEMARGIN Bottom="283" Left="283" Right="283" Top="283"/></SHAPEOBJECT><INSIDEMARGIN Bottom="141" Left="141" Right="141" Top="141"/><ROW><CELL BorderFill="6" ColAddr="0" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="false" HasMargin="false" Header="false" Height="3231" Protect="false" RowAddr="0" RowSpan="1" Width="3705"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="141" Left="141" Right="141" Top="141"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="23" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="8"><CHAR>Ⅶ</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="7" ColAddr="1" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="false" HasMargin="false" Header="false" Height="3231" Protect="false" RowAddr="0" RowSpan="1" Width="1131"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="141" Left="141" Right="141" Top="141"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="0" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"/></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="8" ColAddr="2" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="false" HasMargin="false" Header="false" Height="3231" Protect="false" RowAddr="0" RowSpan="1" Width="26345"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="141" Left="141" Right="141" Top="141"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ColumnBreak="false" PageBreak="false" ParaShape="24" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="12"><COLDEF Count="1" Layout="Left" SameGap="0" SameSize="true" Type="Newspaper"/><CHAR>요청사항</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL></ROW></TABLE><CHAR/></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="29" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="23"><CHAR>❍ </CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="20"><CHAR>시범운영 참여 부서는 개선의견 및 오류사례를 4월 25일까지
민원행정과 스마트행정TF에 이메일로 송부 바랍니다.</CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="20"><CHAR>
</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="29" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="23"><CHAR>❍ </CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="20"><CHAR>기타 문의는 스마트행정TF팀(내선 2413)으로 연락 요망</CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="20"><CHAR>
</CHAR></TEXT></P></SECTION></BODY><TAIL><SCRIPTCODE Type="JScript" Version="1.0"><SCRIPTHEADER/><SCRIPTSOURCE/></SCRIPTCODE></TAIL></HWPML>